{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "0e2a98e18a254cddd43fc8c4ac15f043b5e00a10d4cb73d7c844566fb635c417", "ja": "おはよー、ございまーす……。\n{$P$}、いますかー……？", "zh": "您早……\n请问{$P$}在吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1001_p", "source_sha256": "8f1c8dce6f8e9cd360bcba5b2cdefc6c5ec8c6cdf2fe8c7c6e94247aa905af26", "ja": "おはよう、のり子。\n……いきなり敬語なんて使って、どうしたんだ？", "zh": "早安，法子。\n……你怎么突然讲话变这么恭敬？发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1002_043nor", "source_sha256": "a86ba6db205627f7fe68ba684ecc60c54522b02acc5a6b4df6ae7c5762e92bc1", "ja": "{$P$}！\nあーっと、その……この前はごめんっ！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n啊，就是，那个……之前真的很抱歉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1003_p", "source_sha256": "f48698d45347c30e6b242ba0eb99c04f8c960e6f542a204a3fb003529fa978a5", "ja": "えーと……何の話だ？", "zh": "呃……你是指哪件事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "d97cbac63d533f237fafcbeff7ff4b65a1bb599699b6bca74489b2b653279c0f", "ja": "この前一緒にプロレス観に行った時、アタシ、\nつい夢中になっちゃって、近くにいた人を……その。", "zh": "之前我们一起去看职业摔角的时候，\n我一不小心太投入，就把旁边的人……那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1005_p", "source_sha256": "424ee53073f54cba0382ed81b0089eaf333243bdaaec59d2fe050ad5763ed78c", "ja": "ああ、その事なら気にしなくていいよ。\n相手の人も、怒ってなかったし……。", "zh": "喔，那件事你不用介意啦。\n毕竟对方也没有生气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1006_p", "source_sha256": "0215ce368483dba0bd729135919a3df5de37abe2d113bf174eea9b901bdc44e7", "ja": "むしろ、のり子がアイドルだって知って、\nファンになってくれそうな勢いだったじゃないか。", "zh": "反倒在知道法子是偶像后，\n一副要成为法子粉丝的样子不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "88d49ba9a2596b618c6b1d76879f0c12d2ce3e0d4eeb77d9ffb2bc5d9fb084ac", "ja": "それは、{$P$}が一緒に\n謝ってくれたからだよ！　本当にありがとう……。", "zh": "那都是因为{$P$}\n陪我向对方道歉的缘故！真的很谢谢你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "842a86c81d204f33ffe2803e349d9305d552d2a6a723f902d3675e0394b10f52", "ja": "だいたいアタシ、初めて{$P$}に\n会った時にも、同じコトしちゃったのに。うう……。", "zh": "而且我第一次见到{$P$}时，\n明明也做过一样的事，呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1009_p", "source_sha256": "983b15980b6eaef2d96acfb05b183cb00012ed36bc3f2e47ea9c6183fe65148b", "ja": "そうだったな……でも、プロレスはのり子と一緒に\n観ると楽しいって、改めて思ったよ。また行こうな！", "zh": "是有这么一回事……不过这也让我再次体会到，\n跟法子一起看职业摔角很有趣，所以下次再一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1010_043nor", "source_sha256": "55054e3e7982332a3ac5b485b94b0a40d8f576f867c88f08cf594de5090c3afe", "ja": "{$P$}、ありがとう！\n今度こそ、静かにプロレス観戦してみせるよっ！", "zh": "{$P$}，谢谢你！\n我下次一定会安安静静地看比赛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1011_se", "source_sha256": "5db4309ae37b0efc26ae851c4220ed2d654c20fa01a175fe7f69eeee99c0ddda", "ja": "バシィーーーン！！", "zh": "啪────！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1012_p", "source_sha256": "3c6a001308d158e3f156493eeed07d7f001f13f9130505a80220702980ba4bce", "ja": "ぐはっ！？", "zh": "呜啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_043nor0082_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_043nor0082_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "be12510c1e86b0363095c84e3a9dc877b35ffde2491683993096ae527d4d71d3", "ja": "ああっ！？　ごめん、{$P$}！\n……もう、アタシのバカー！！", "zh": "啊！？抱歉，{$P$}！\n……真是的，我这个笨蛋──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
